[0.001, "o", "\u001b[31m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[31m CRITICAL: Information-Flow Exfiltration Path → 'write_file' [AG-TRIFECTA] \u001b[0m\u001b[31m─\u001b[0m\u001b[31m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Agent: \u001b[1magent\u001b[0m                                                                 \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Lethal trifecta detected: untrusted input can control the egress tool        \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m 'write_file' while internal/sensitive data flows to it, creating a provable  \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m exfiltration path.                                                           \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Control path (attacker steers the sink):                                     \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m   search_web → __llm__ → write_file                                          \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m                                      "]
