[0.000, "o", "\u001b[31m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[31m────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[31m CRITICAL: Unrestricted Shell/Exec Access [AG-001] \u001b[0m\u001b[31m─────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[31m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Agent: \u001b[1magent\u001b[0m                                                                 \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Tool: \u001b[1mrun_python\u001b[0m                                                             \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Tool 'run_python' can execute arbitrary code/commands and is not sandboxed.  \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mAttack:\u001b[0m A prompt injection or malicious user input could cause the agent to  \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m execute arbitrary system commands with the agent's process permissions.      \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mBlast radius:\u001b[0m Full system access as the agent's process user. All "]
