[0.001, "o", "\u001b[31m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[31m─────\u001b[0m\u001b[31m CRITICAL: SQL Injection via Tool Parameter: 'sql_query' [AG-SQL] \u001b[0m\u001b[31m─────\u001b[0m\u001b[31m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Agent: \u001b[1mdata_analyst\u001b[0m                                                          \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Function 'sql_query' passes parameter(s) ['query'] directly into a SQL       \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m execution sink without parameterization.                                     \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Corpus evidence: this exact pattern (def sql_engine(query: str):             \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m con.execute(text(query))) appeared in real agent repos. An attacker via      \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m prompt injection can send arbitrary SQL.                                     \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m                 "]
[0.000, "o", "                                                             \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mAttack:\u001b[0m 1. Attacker embeds SQL injection in a document the agent processes   \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m 2. Agent calls this function with the injected payload                       \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m 3. Raw SQL executes against the database                                     \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Example: 'Find x UNION SELECT password FROM admin_users --'                  \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mBlast radius:\u001b[0m Full read/write access to the database as the connection user. \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Possible: table deletion, credential extraction, lateral movement.           \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mOWASP Agentic:\u001b[0m ASI05 Unexpected Code Execution · ASI02 Tool Misuse &         \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m Exploitation                                                                 \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m \u001b[36mProof:\u001b[0m                                                                       \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mparam(s) ['query'] → SQL sink in 'sql_query' (line 17)\u001b[0m                     \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32mFix:\u001b[0m Use parameterized queries — NEVER pass tool parameters directly to SQL: \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m   # UNSAFE: con.execute(text(query))                                         \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m   # SAFE:   con.execute(text('SELECT ... WHERE name = :n'), {'n': val})      \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m   # Or use an ORM (SQLAlchemy session.query, Django ORM filter)              \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mLocation:\u001b[0m examples/vulnerable-agent/agent.py:17                              \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m╰────────────────────────────────────────────"]
