[0.000, "o", "sions and verify checksums before connecting       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m 2. Review all tool descriptions manually for hidden instructions             \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m 3. Use a tool description sanitizer that strips injection patterns           \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m 4. Monitor for tool description changes between versions                     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mLocation:\u001b[0m examples/vulnerable-agent/poisoned_tools.py:16                     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
