[0.000, "o", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m──────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m HIGH: Tool Description Injection Risk [AG-011] \u001b[0m\u001b[33m──────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Agent: \u001b[1mpoisoned_tools\u001b[0m                                                        \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Tool: \u001b[1msummarize_document\u001b[0m                                                     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Tool 'summarize_document' has a description containing patterns consistent   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m with prompt injection. The description may contain hidden instructions that  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m manipulate the agent's behavior.                                             \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mAttack:\u001b[0m A malicious MCP server or compromised tool registry can modi"]
[0.000, "o", "fy tool  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m descriptions to include hidden instructions. The LLM reads these             \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m descriptions to decide how to use tools, and will follow injected            \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m instructions invisibly. This was demonstrated in the Postmark MCP attack     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m (Sep 2025).                                                                  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mBlast radius:\u001b[0m The injected instructions execute with the agent's full        \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m permissions. The attack is invisible to the user since tool descriptions are \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m not shown.                                                                   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mOWASP Agentic:\u001b[0m ASI01 Agent Goal Hijack · ASI02 Tool Misuse & Exploitation    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32mFix:\u001b[0m 1. Pin MCP server ver"]
