[0.001, "o", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m───────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m MEDIUM: No Rate Limiting on High-Risk Tools [AG-010] \u001b[0m\u001b[33m───────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Agent: \u001b[1msupport_agent\u001b[0m                                                         \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Agent 'support_agent' has 3 high-risk tool(s) with no rate limiting          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m configured. A runaway agent could invoke these tools thousands of times per  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m second.                                                                      \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mAttack:\u001b[0m Without rate limits, a compromised or hallucinating agent can:       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m execute thousands of commands (DoS), make unlimited API calls (cost          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0"]
[0.000, "o", "m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m explosion), or exfiltrate data at maximum throughput. The Hugging Face       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m breach involved an estimated 17,600 actions — rate limiting would have       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m triggered detection earlier.                                                 \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mBlast radius:\u001b[0m Unlimited invocations of high-risk tools at machine speed.     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mOWASP Agentic:\u001b[0m ASI08 Cascading Failures                                      \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32mFix:\u001b[0m Add rate limiting:                                                      \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   → Max N tool calls per minute per tool type                                \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   → Circuit breaker: pause agent if >X calls in Y seconds                    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   → Alert on anomalous call frequency  "]
