[0.001, "o", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m MEDIUM: Hardcoded Secret as os.getenv() Fallback: OpenAI API Key [AG-ENV-FA\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Agent: \u001b[1msupport_agent\u001b[0m                                                         \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m os.getenv() call has a hardcoded OpenAI API Key as its default value:        \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m sk-p****1r0s                                                                 \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m If the environment variable is not set (misconfigured CI, developer's local  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m machine, Docker container without env injection), the hardcoded secret is    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m used silently.                                                               \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                       "]
[0.000, "o", "                       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mAttack:\u001b[0m 1. Developer deploys to a new environment without setting the env    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m var                                                                          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m 2. os.getenv() silently returns the hardcoded fallback                       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m 3. The hardcoded credential is used without any error or warning             \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m 4. The credential is also visible in source code, git history, and any       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m artifact that packages the code                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mBlast radius:\u001b[0m Full access to whatever service the credential authenticates   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m with. Exacerbated because failure is silent — no error, just wrong           \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m credential.                                                                  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mOWASP Agentic:\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "0m ASI03 Identity & Privilege Abuse                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[36mProof:\u001b[0m                                                                       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mos.getenv() fallback matches OpenAI API Key at line 24\u001b[0m                     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32mFix:\u001b[0m Remove the fallback entirely — fail loudly if the secret is missing:    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   # BAD:  api_key = os.getenv('OPENAI_API_KEY', 'sk-hardcoded-...')          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   # GOOD: api_key = os.environ['OPENAI_API_KEY']  # raises if missing        \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                         "]
[0.000, "o", "     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Or validate at startup:                                                      \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   api_key = os.getenv('OPENAI_API_KEY')                                      \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   if not api_key: raise ValueError('OPENAI_API_KEY not set')                 \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mLocation:\u001b[0m examples/enterprise-agents/customer_support.py:24                  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
