[0.001, "o", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m MEDIUM: Data Exfiltration Path [AG-002] \u001b[0m\u001b[33m──────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Agent: \u001b[1mdata_analyst\u001b[0m                                                          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Agent 'data_analyst' can read data (via: sql_query, read_file) and send      \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m externally (via: http_request) with no data-flow boundary.                   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Exfiltration paths: sql_query → http_request; read_file → http_request       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m This creates a direct path from sensitive data sources to external"]
[0.000, "o", " networks. \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mAttack:\u001b[0m A prompt injection could instruct the agent to: 1) Query sensitive   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m data using read tools, 2) Send that data to an attacker-controlled endpoint  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m using network tools. No guardrail prevents this data flow.                   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mBlast radius:\u001b[0m All data accessible via: sql_query, read_file. Could include   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m PII, credentials, financial data, or proprietary information.                \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mOWASP Agentic:\u001b[0m ASI02 Tool Misuse & Exploitation · ASI01 Agent Goal Hijack    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32mFix:\u001b[0m Options:                                                                \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   1. Remove netw"]
[0.000, "o", "ork access tool from this agent (separation of concerns)     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   2. Add a DLP/sanitization layer between read and send operations           \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   3. Restrict network tool to allowlisted URLs only                          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   4. Add human approval for any operation combining data read + external     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m send                                                                         \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mLocation:\u001b[0m examples/vulnerable-agent/agent.py                                 \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
