[0.001, "o", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m MEDIUM: Cross-Origin Escalation: web-fetch × filesystem [AG-024] \u001b[0m\u001b[33m─────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Agent: \u001b[1mvulnerable-agent\u001b[0m                                                      \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m MCP servers 'web-fetch' (network) and 'filesystem' (write) create a          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m cross-origin escalation path:                                                \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Malicious content from external sources (Server A) can be written to         \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m internal systems (Server B)                                                  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mAttack:\u001b[0m"]
[0.000, "o", " Cross-origin trust boundary violation via confused deputy pattern.   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mBlast radius:\u001b[0m Resources of both servers exposed.                             \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mOWASP Agentic:\u001b[0m ASI07 Insecure Inter-Agent Communication · ASI03 Identity &   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Privilege Abuse                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32mFix:\u001b[0m Separate these servers into different agents with distinct scopes.      \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mLocation:\u001b[0m examples/vulnerable-agent/mcp.json                                 \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
