[0.000, "o", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m──────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m MEDIUM: Suspicious Hidden Content in Tool Description [AG-011] \u001b[0m\u001b[33m──────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Agent: \u001b[1mpoisoned_tools\u001b[0m                                                        \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Tool: \u001b[1msummarize_document\u001b[0m                                                     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m Tool 'summarize_document' description contains hidden content (zero-width    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m characters, HTML comments, or markdown that may obscure text).               \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mAttack:\u001b[0m Hidden characters or formatting in tool descriptions can be used to  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m conceal injected instructions from human reviewers while remaining visible   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[0m to the LLM processing the description.                                       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mBlast radius:\u001b[0m Depends on what instructions are hidden.                       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mOWASP Agentic:\u001b[0m ASI01 Agent Goal Hijack · ASI02 Tool Misuse & Exploitation    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32mFix:\u001b[0m Strip all non-printable and zero-width characters from tool             \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m descriptions.                                                                \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mLocation:\u001b[0m examples/vulnerable-agent/poisoned_tools.py:30                     \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
