[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[2m───────\u001b[0m\u001b[2m LOW: Hardcoded Secret: PII: Email Address in Config [AG-007] \u001b[0m\u001b[2m───────\u001b[0m\u001b[2m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m Agent: \u001b[1msupport_agent\u001b[0m                                                         \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m Found hardcoded PII: Email Address in Config in source code: \"sup****com\"    \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mAttack:\u001b[0m Secrets in source code can be extracted by anyone with repo access,  \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m leaked via git history, or exposed through agent error messages. If this     \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m agent is compromised, the attacker gets these credentials.                   \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mBlast radius:\u001b[0m All resources accessible via this PII: Email Address in        \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m Config.       "]
[0.000, "o", "                                                               \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mOWASP Agentic:\u001b[0m ASI03 Identity & Privilege Abuse                              \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m                                                                              \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32mFix:\u001b[0m Move secrets to environment variables or a secrets manager.             \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m   → Use: os.environ['API_KEY'] instead of hardcoding                         \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m   → Or: Load from .env file (excluded from version control)                  \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mLocation:\u001b[0m examples/enterprise-agents/customer_support.py:85                  \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
